{"ID":"20240515131422-pn199d5","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131422-pn199d5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131422-pn199d5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134942-vcfm3hz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134942-vcfm3hz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515134942-vcfm3hz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:333,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:333\u0026#125;","title":"047","type":"doc","updated":"20240515134942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515134942-vcfm3hz","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 924px;","id":"20240515134942-vcfm3hz","updated":"20240515134942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/8/5"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GT"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"80歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/8/19"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺癌複診，上次複診有腳患，今已除。但因氣喘及血壓升至160故擔心來診。本週起不能平躺睡覺，且自述減了四磅。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１.胃口：很好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２.口渴：渴，喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３.小便：淡黃，流量好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４.大便：每日行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５.睡眠：因夜尿三、四次故斷續醒來，但醒後能再睡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６.身體寒熱：日間無寒熱，夜裡覺全身熱，但腳仍冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"７.體力：很好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"８.雙足：冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：浮大，關大於寸。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃紅\n2、眼診 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong strong","TextMarkTextContent":":"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 肺區黃為有痰，有白點為肺癌。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 肺中陰實仍在"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"沿用前方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子五錢，白芍一兩，炙甘草五錢，葦莖四錢，丹皮三錢，桃仁三錢，冬瓜仁三錢，黃蓍五錢，牛膝三錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說： 病人所患肺癌，但四肢黃而瘦，是肺結核的表徵，在中醫觀念，肺結核是癆症之一種，治法當依癆症。此外，肺脈就是浮脈，常人脈象是寸比關浮，關比尺浮，一直往下沉的，這才符合陰陽。但病人則是關脈比寸脈浮大，是陰陽相反的證明，再加查脈之有無附骨，並加眼診，可斷其陰實未去，故續用前方。"}]}]}]}]}